Borzoi dogs are typically medium to large-sized, with males being larger than females. They have a lean and athletic build, with a deep chest and long legs. Their coat is usually short and smooth, although some may have a slightly longer, softer coat.

Behaviorally, Borzois are known for their gentle and affectionate nature. They are loyal and protective of their families, but can be aloof towards strangers. They are also known for their hunting instincts, which can make them excellent companions for outdoor activities such as hiking or running.


