3. **Size and Proportions**: Weimaraners are medium to large-sized dogs, with males typically weighing between 70-90 pounds and females slightly lighter at around 60-80 pounds. They have a balanced body structure with a deep chest, strong legs, and a broad, muscular back. Their height ranges from 23-27 inches at the shoulder.

